     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I would like to plot the fitting result using RStan.</div><div>This successfully generated the result, which is saved in fit.</div><div>When I use </div><div><br></div><div>plot(fit, pars=par)</div><div><br></div><div>it worked.</div><div><br></div><div>But, when I use</div><div>qqplot(fit)+geom_line()</div><div><br></div><div>it did not work.</div><div><br></div><div>I did not forget library(ggplot2).</div><div><br></div><div>I am wondering if </div><div><br></div><div>rstan::extract(fit)</div><div><br></div><div>is needed.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks in advance for your kind help</div></div>"
    ]
